From de00c18d4864e8e48bd487685b4dcbe1de3a9a80 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:16:52 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Connect only when the user asks; quieter status when the
 Docker host drops; README for the Debian Docker host VM

- auto-connect defaults to off; the Connect dialog no longer opens by itself at start
- a host saved as default/recent only once Docker answered
- /api/status and the shared client turn SSH/socket errors into a one-line 503 (no tracebacks)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LG6ytc3mBGTzNm9wqY1n5n
